00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:21.660
- [Kelly] She's adorable.

00:01:21.660 --> 00:01:22.493
- Yeah.

00:01:22.493 --> 00:01:23.326
- [Kelly] Oh my gosh.

00:01:23.326 --> 00:01:24.214
